7
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:26,840
(Choi Seungwoo)

8
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,480
(Jeno)

9
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,560
(Peck - Nueng - Leo)

10
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,880
(Secretary Fah - Teerach - Ms. Nichakorn)

11
